    3: // Source slicing for the rolling window (plans/scoreview-stream.md S2):
    4: // cuts a MusicXML score into per-measure pieces and re-emits any bar range
    5: // as a self-contained document — the original measures VERBATIM (the
    6: // fidelity trick the recording script proved), with the accumulated
    7: // attribute state (divisions, key, time, staves, clefs) injected at the
    8: // window head so a window starting at bar 20 still knows what bar 1
    9: // declared. Fabricated bars join in S3 through the same window path.
